sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: Charging Station has log information available

    CSMS->>CS: GetLogRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: GetLogRequest<br>- logType SecurityLog
    CS-->>CSMS: GetLogResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploading, requestId = same Id as the GetLogRequest)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploaded, requestId = same Id as the GetLogRequest)
    CS-->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationResponse
    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 6 is drawn as the header states it (Test System responds).<br>The header probably means the CSMS responds, as in step 4.
